# Firebase config. Its Android API key is an identifier, not a secret: it ships
# inside every APK, and the database rules and key restrictions are what protect
# the data (see SECURITY.md and docs/EXTERNAL_ACTIONS.md). The committed copy is
# deliberately still tracked so CI can build (ignore rules don't affect tracked
# files); this entry keeps stray copies elsewhere out of git.
app/google-services.json
google-services.json

# Release signing keys never belong in git (CI decodes one from a secret).
*.jks
release.keystore

